  Facts:
  - text: "The Armored Scuttler!\nCrabs wear their skeleton on the outside like armor\u2014this
      is called an exoskeleton!\nThey move sideways using their strong legs and use
      their claws to grab food or defend themselves.\nWhen they grow too big for
      their shell, they shed it and grow a new one.\nIt\u2019s like getting a brand
      new suit of armor!"
